WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.833
Saturday, 11:17 PM.

00:00:03.093 --> 00:00:06.536
John asks about the 2022 Wakesetter on your website.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.801
Most dealers promise a call on Monday.

00:00:10.155 --> 00:00:11.052
59 hours later,

00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:12.913
he’s gone with North Lake.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.538
With the AI Sales Captain,

00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:17.477
John gets a text in 47 seconds,

00:00:17.497 --> 00:00:19.605
about the exact model.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.341
It asks the three questions your best rep would ask,

00:00:23.361 --> 00:00:25.422
and he answers from his couch.

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:29.557
By 11:31, the showing is booked for Tuesday at 10,

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:32.231
with his full profile attached.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.500
Total rep time:

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.966
zero minutes.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.075
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
